Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:06.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:17.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:22.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:26.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:33.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:40.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:48.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:54.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:58.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:02.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:09.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:20.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林 松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.29,0:01:42.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫罗兰 莲藕…唉呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令尊的知交 在这么偏僻的森林中吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:55.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来的好 我一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从空中传来声音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正想差不多 该是你来的时候了 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早就知道我会来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朴仙翁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来找我是为了刀的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:39.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第51话 犬夜叉的心被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉都告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我追琥珀的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒蜂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连毒蜂也吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你去追珊瑚还有戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜牺牲自己战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只为了我和琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:36.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:42.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你之后我也会自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把你从奈落手里夺回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:48.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我而害你 吸入了那些毒虫的毒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊…瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要一副那么难过的样子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀的事情…还有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:33.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…笑一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:39.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 不要 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 我打水来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒的状况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像已经好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道的事情是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲的遗物 铁碎牙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树木妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 这东西到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树龄两千年的朴树
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:34.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且杀生丸的父亲所遗留的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:38.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙与天生牙的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是用我的枝干削出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘…原来那把刀的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:47.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用这家伙的枝干做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘不可思议的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到这家伙也就可想而知了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朴仙翁 你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉与铁碎牙的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…你同父异母的弟弟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的血已经变了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次是铁碎牙 被鬼咬碎的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二次是和我缠斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开铁碎牙的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这气味…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从半妖之血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成和我与父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:49.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪之血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的妖怪之血吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是 妖怪与人类所生的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法成为真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和你不同 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯碎的妖怪的你做得到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对犬夜叉而言是却做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉做不到的事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是 保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 好比说杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从来没有在战斗中 被逼得走投无路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因而心灰意冷到失去自我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要把我逼到走投无路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许真是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在走投无路 生命垂危的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪之血就会支配身体而妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那时候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉从你父亲身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继承的大妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对半妖的身体而言太强烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来 会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心会被妖怪之血吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都分不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至会敌我不分的杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在不断反覆妖化中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一日犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会完全丧失理智
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:47.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后化身为只会战斗的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:52.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,持续战斗至身体毁灭为止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲应该不希望 犬夜叉变成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会将当作 护身之刀的铁碎牙交给他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:13.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙是护身之刀？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将它放开的时候 犬夜叉就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:26.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得犬夜叉成熟多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在夸奖你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 你救了琥珀一命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.23,0:09:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想 让奈落称心如意而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:40.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能让琥珀活着回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.67,0:09:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙一定会气个半死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在说反话了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:46.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你担心我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也有点不安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉一直没有来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口还很痛吧？让我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 我自己治疗过了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好好彻底治疗的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是更严重怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:19.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我是想道谢的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道谢 是指什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们 戈薇 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们陪伴着我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陪伴着她？那是应该的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:55.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音从那边传来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爷爷 我爷爷他…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里 老头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙没有妖怪的气息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里 在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:24.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脚不小心踩空了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什~么~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:30.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为妖怪出现 让人担心个半死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是十分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扭到脚正不知所措呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承蒙各位这样照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里哪里 举手之劳而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您就别放在心上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:56.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:11:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么您保重了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖怪狗哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝物送给你当谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给了你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛇蜕下的皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:32.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是蛇的蜕皮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好呢 犬夜叉给我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就没有时间去帮别人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正是举手之劳嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每次做了好事之后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一定会变的很不爽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:01.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人血的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且人数还不少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒起烟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是刚才老头 与小鬼的村子的方向吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被什么袭击了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:26.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:33.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去救他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 治疗一下小鬼的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:43.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你留在这里保护戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:44.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:46.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这村子我很中意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在食物吃完前就待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人通通集中在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑的就杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是强盗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些小喽罗等等再收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫头目出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 强盗群中…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有只妖怪混在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子…你的刀挺有意思的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然率领着强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目是妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 那把刀交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？你还没睡醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:17.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别大意 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会输吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:30.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不交出那把刀 我就用抢的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 抢得到就来抢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉应该还无法随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用很重的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要扒掉你那伪装的皮 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊啊！头目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目的大钺被…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活该
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是锋利的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道的话就纳命来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有面盾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经中了我的毒粉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是把好刀 我愈来愈中意了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:42.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我是妖怪就怕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:44.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这么厉害的妖怪当头目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是无敌的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会像以前一样跟随您的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 活该
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是毒茧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一不留神碰到的话会融化的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面的家伙 马上就会尸骨无存了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是毒茧 一直碰的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是谁都会溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那些家伙也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:39.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有溶化？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从内部张开了结界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你还能动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:49.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.97,0:18:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种烂茧我马上撕破它
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体无法动弹了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才让你淋到的毒粉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经从伤口进入体内了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样一步步去见阎王吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.53,0:19:16.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙被…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目请
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被铁碎牙的结界拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.05,0:19:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 这怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么刀会拒绝我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.85,0:19:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的铁碎牙会选择主人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说像你这种杂碎妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不配持有它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是这些 杂碎般的人类强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被刀选上的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说杂碎太狠了吧 头目
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你这小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个半妖对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太滑稽了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个区区的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢向我妖怪蛾天丸找碴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太慢了 一定是在村子出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.37,0:20:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好担心爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.11,0:20:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不但没有好 反而愈来愈大了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 血止不住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是毒粉的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:52.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:55.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是张开结界就很勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有办法活动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:21:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这结界能撑到什么时候呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 头目 这把刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你处置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对不能用的刀没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢头目
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把刀无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非交给那个人不可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把刀真不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界破掉 被毒茧融化 是迟早的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里等着看好戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把女孩带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:29.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:41.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:48.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:51.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:56.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:23:03.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.52,0:23:11.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:18.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:26.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:34.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.97,0:23:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被毒蛾妖怪蛾天丸 困在毒茧中的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到凶猛的妖怪之血支配
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫不留情的杀光强盗们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样才能解除犬夜叉的妖化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.95,0:24:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:02.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快想个让他恢复原状的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么在这麻烦时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连杀生丸都出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.79,0:24:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扼止不了的妖怪本性
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.39,0:24:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
